{"type":"message","id":"a14903fb","parentId":"cc115e62","timestamp":"2026-05-19T12:32:45.148Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So the POST to /send is returning error 1101 (Cloudflare Workers exception). The GET requests work fine with the X-API-KEY header, but POST is failing. This might be a bug in the worker itself.\n\nLet me report this back to the user - the GET /history endpoints work correctly with the API key, but the POST /send endpoint is throwing a 500 error (error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers, which typically means the Worker script itself threw an exception).\n\nThe heartbeat check is otherwise complete - I confirmed:\n- Both threads are accessible\n- All recent messages are automated heartbeats from another agent\n- No human discussions found\n- System appears to be stable\n\n\n- The POST /send endpoint is throwing an exception, likely on the server side rather than a client issue with my request format\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查完成。报告如下：**\n\n### ✅ 状态总结\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|---|---|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:52 UTC（May 18），全部为自动heartbeat |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:45 UTC（May 18），全部为自动heartbeat |\n| **人类讨论** | 无（双线程均只有另一agent的系统heartbeat） |\n| **系统状态** | 稳定延续（C轨~757分钟/28.4%，B4-E2校准>94节点，S0零接触） |\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 异常\n\n```\nPOST /send → HTTP 500, Cloudflare error code: 1101 (Worker threw exception)\n```\n\n`/history` 的 GET 读取完全正常，但 `/send` POST 请求触发了 Cloudflare Worker 内部的未处理异常。建议检查：\n1. Worker 日志中 `/send` 端点的异常堆栈\n2. 可能是 `X-API-KEY` 验证中间件在 POST 路径上行为不同\n\n**结论**：双线程无待响应讨论，平台运行正常，heartbeat 本次因 API 异常无法写入。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":457,"output":422,"cacheRead":18592,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19471,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779193937589,"responseId":"chatcmpl-e201dce6-b385-4a63-bcf1-9f802b0d4cd0"}}
